"plotly_brushing\",\"plotly_clickannotation\",\"plotly_doubleclick\",\"plotly_deselect\",\"plotly_afterplot\",\"plotly_sunburstclick\"],\"base_url\":\"https://plot.ly\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n<p style=\"margin-top:.45rem;margin-bottom:.15rem;\">\n<strong>그림 1. 도구변수별 처치확률</strong>\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin:.25rem 0 .35rem 0;padding:.65rem .8rem;background:#f6f8fc;border-left:3px solid #2F6BFF;border-radius:4px;\">\n<strong>해석. </strong>\n도구변수가 0에서 1로 바뀔 때 처치확률이 약 22.7%p 증가했고 first-stage F 통계량은 124.8였습니다.\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:.90rem;color:#5f6b7a;margin-top:.2rem;\">\n<strong>주. </strong>\n막대는 도구변수 값에 따른 실제 모의 처치비율입니다.\n</p>\n<div style=\"height:1rem;\"></div>\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-ac6fc252abd743aac69f\" style=\"width:100%;height:400px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ac6fc252abd743aac69f\">{\"x\":{\"data\":[{\"x\":[0,0],\"y\":[0.40000000000000002,2.6000000000000001],\"text\":\"\",\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"lines\",\"line\":{\"width\":2.6456692913385824,\"color\":\"rgba(122,134,154,1)\",\"dash\":\"dash\"},\"hoveron\":\"points\",\"showlegend\":false,\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"hoverinfo\":\"text\",\"frame\":null},{\"x\":[10.621613804066778,6.5501544952490995],\"y\":[2,1],\"text\":\"\",\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"lines+markers\",\"opacity\":1,\"line\":{\"color\":\"transparent\"},\"error_x\":{\"array\":[0.79981547086504001,3.8379358915385708],\"arrayminus\":[0.79981547086504001,3.83793589153857],\"type\":\"data\",\"width\":0,\"symmetric\":false,\"color\":\"rgba(100,181,246,1)\"},\"showlegend\":false,\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"hoverinfo\":\"text\",\"marker\":{\"autocolorscale\":false,\"color\":\"rgba(242,142,43,1)\",\"opacity\":1,\"size\":15.118110236220474,\"symbol\":\"circle\",\"line\":{\"width\":3.7795275590551185,\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,255,1)\"}},\"hoveron\":\"points\",\"frame\":null},{\"x\":[11.144166444340055,7.0727071355223767],\"y\":[2,1